{"4723320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Dread", "steam_appid": 4723320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Dread is a Medieval Dark Fantasy Horror game. You wake up in a dungeon. Everyone is gone. Have your premonitions finally come true? You must use what you can find around you to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A FALLING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through interconnected environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crumbling castle dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground ruins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location tells a story through decay and silence. Nothing here is untouched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DARK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge limited resources and craft what you need to stay alive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torches to push back darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised tools and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutter as a method of distraction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource matters. Every choice has weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTELLIGENT HUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures beneath the world are not mindless. They:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your presence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth, awareness, and planning are your only protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/9aaaa592a6bac5da88fb75c5de04a31d.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/9aaaa592a6bac5da88fb75c5de04a31d.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/9aaaa592a6bac5da88fb75c5de04a31d.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESCENT INTO MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something beneath the world is stirring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A presence once guided the kingdom toward prosperity. Now only silence and ruin remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you descend deeper, the truth behind your visions begins to surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/8c42d7bd267549837c8161007a8e1620.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/8c42d7bd267549837c8161007a8e1620.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/8c42d7bd267549837c8161007a8e1620.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Dread is a Medieval Dark Fantasy Horror game. You wake up in a dungeon. Everyone is gone. Have your premonitions finally come true? You must use what you can find around you to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A FALLING WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through interconnected environments:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crumbling castle dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned mines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground ruins</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location tells a story through decay and silence. Nothing here is untouched.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/906b233614a4c5f459ab8e8e8aa9d9e6.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DARK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge limited resources and craft what you need to stay alive.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Torches to push back darkness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improvised tools and weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clutter as a method of distraction</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every resource matters. Every choice has weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.webm?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/3ecec8e2f71bb0699ed6e827da200c1b.mp4?t=1781082910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTELLIGENT HUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures beneath the world are not mindless. They:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >React to your actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your presence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to the environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth, awareness, and planning are your only protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4723320/extras/9aaaa592a6bac5da88fb75c5de04a31d.poster.avif?t=1781082910\" width=640 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite